{"id":"legal","lemma":"legal","pos":"adj","rank":1433,"glosses":["legal","statutory","lawful"],"ipa":"/leˈɡal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"legales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-legal.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto es totalmente legal.","en":"This is perfectly legal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/548161"},{"text":"¿Son legales los fuegos artificiales en Australia?","en":"Are fireworks legal in Australia?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302425"},{"text":"Todo es perfectamente legal.","en":"It's all perfectly legal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/552179"},{"text":"Los juegos de azar son legales en Nevada.","en":"Gambling is legal in Nevada.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/765374"},{"text":"Él es el dueño legal de la empresa.","en":"He is the lawful owner of the company.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/688876"}]}